menu "Muse radio page"

config MUSE_RADIO_ENABLED
    bool "Internet radio page"
    default y
    help
        Adds a swipe page listing a handful of internet radio stations and
        plays the one you tap through the speaker. Turning this off leaves
        the page out of the tileview entirely, so settings stays one swipe
        closer to the character.

        The station list is compiled in (muse_radio.c), and every URL in it
        must be plain MP3 over HTTPS: there is no AAC or Ogg decoder on the
        board, and the page refuses a stream whose Content-Type is neither.

endmenu
